OL,5,G1850 Grand Designs
OL,6,     FKevin McCloud revisits Adrian and
OL,7,     FMegan, whose cutting-edge concrete
OL,8,     Fbunker became a nightmare build.
OL,9,     FWith the house now complete,
OL,10,     Fwhat's it like to live in such a
OL,11,     Fraw, exposed home?
OL,12,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FCan a pair of first-timers really
OL,14,     Fturn a cowshed into a warm, cosy
OL,15,     Fhome by learning how to do
OL,16,     Feverything from the internet?
OL,17,     FKevin McCloud visits their
OL,18,     Fextraordinary build in Somerset.
